   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1791790154398,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "LEGEND (box color):\nLight blue = trigger/lock   Yellow = guard/identity   Orange = Tally API (odbcService.js)   Light yellow = batch control\nPurple = parse   Lilac = map/classify   Green = save (persistence)   Pink = MongoDB model\n\nBold blue arrows = main path down the stages. Thin arrows = inside a row, left to right.\nSales, Purchase, CN, DN all use steps S1–S9. Only S5 (fetch) and S8 (save) change by voucher type.\nNot drawn: reconciliation, voucher recovery, line backfill, master pipelines (see docs/TALLY_TO_MONGO_FILES.md section 5).",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "LEGEND (box color):\nLight blue = trigger/lock   Yellow = guard/identity   Orange = Tally API (odbcService.js)   Light yellow = batch control\nPurple = parse   Lilac = map/classify   Green = save (persistence)   Pink = MongoDB model\n\nBold blue arrows = main path down the stages. Thin arrows = inside a row, left to right.\nSales, Purchase, CN, DN all use steps S1–S9. Only S5 (fetch) and S8 (save) change by voucher type.\nNot drawn: reconciliation, voucher recovery, line backfill, master pipelines (see docs/TALLY_TO_MONGO_FILES.md section 5).",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.3
  }
 ],
 "appState": {
